# game/case03.rpy:55
translate japanese press_sakuya_1_8c0d2807:

    # you "How can you be certain of the time?"
    you "どうして時刻に確信が持てる？"

# game/case03.rpy:57
translate japanese press_sakuya_1_fd04fbb6:

    # sakuya "I stop it every day. I always know exactly where I left it."
    sakuya "毎日止めていますから。どこで止めたかは、いつも正確に覚えています。"

# game/case03.rpy:61
translate japanese press_sakuya_2_0e0c44e6:

    # you "Who else was in the mansion at three?"
    you "三時に館にいたのは他に誰だ？"

# game/case03.rpy:63
translate japanese press_sakuya_2_80be7eb0:

    # sakuya "The mistress, her sister, Patchouli, forty fairy maids, and a certain magician. Uninvited."
    sakuya "お嬢様、妹様、パチュリー様、妖精メイド四十人、それにある魔法使い。招かれざる客です。"

# game/case03.rpy:66
translate japanese press_sakuya_2_dab70885:

    # eiki "...The window again, I assume."
    eiki "……また窓ですね、おそらく。"

# game/case03.rpy:70
translate japanese press_sakuya_3_214b97c5:

    # you "Only two? Which two?"
    you "二人だけ？どの二人だ？"

# game/case03.rpy:71
translate japanese press_sakuya_3_b6f8bc4d:

    # sakuya "Meiling, and the mistress herself. Who would never."
    sakuya "美鈴と、お嬢様ご本人です。もちろんお嬢様はなさいません。"

# game/case03.rpy:72
translate japanese press_sakuya_3_aa1a7464:

    # sakuya "Write that down. All of it."
    sakuya "書き留めてください。一言残らず。"

# game/case03.rpy:76
translate japanese press_sakuya_4_0b19e49b:

    # you "Why are those the only two suspects?"
    you "なぜ容疑者はその二人だけなんだ？"

# game/case03.rpy:78
translate japanese press_sakuya_4_b694cb26:

    # sakuya "Because they're the two I considered. That makes the list complete."
    sakuya "私が考えたのがその二人だからです。だから一覧は完全です。"

# game/case03.rpy:80
translate japanese press_sakuya_4_bd1e7763:

    # eiki "A list is complete when it holds everyone, not when you stop writing."
    eiki "一覧が完全なのは、全員が載ったときです。書くのをやめたときではありません。"

# game/case03.rpy:91
translate japanese case3_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case03.rpy:93
translate japanese case3_3a85d08e:

    # eiki "The defendant, Hong Meiling, stands accused of eating the mistress's pudding."
    eiki "被告人、紅美鈴は、お嬢様のプリンを食べた罪に問われています。"

# game/case03.rpy:94
translate japanese case3_5b7a7cf9:

    # komachi "Defendant's asleep at the gate, boss. Seemed rude to wake her."
    komachi "被告人は門の前で寝てますよ、四季様。起こすのも悪いかと。"

# game/case03.rpy:95
translate japanese case3_fcb03c9e:

    # eiki "...We will proceed without her. The witness, please."
    eiki "……被告人抜きで進めます。証人を。"

# game/case03.rpy:98
translate japanese case3_86ddeb38:

    # sakuya "Izayoi Sakuya, head maid. I'll be brief. I have a mansion to run."
    sakuya "十六夜咲夜、メイド長です。手短にいたします。館の仕事がありますので。"

# game/case03.rpy:101
translate japanese case3_10c6eb56:

    # eiki "You accuse your own gatekeeper?"
    eiki "自分の館の門番を訴えるのか？"

# game/case03.rpy:104
translate japanese case3_ca5fc8e3:

    # sakuya "I accuse whoever the facts accuse. Today, the facts are very sleepy."
    sakuya "事実が訴える者を訴えるだけです。今日の事実は、とても眠そうですが。"

# game/case03.rpy:108
translate japanese case3_168658ff:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. A tidy witness gives tidy answers."
    eiki "見習い判事。整った証人は、整った答えをします。"

# game/case03.rpy:109
translate japanese case3_a615c359:

    # eiki "Tidy is not the same as complete. Listen for what she leaves out."
    eiki "整っていることと、完全であることは違います。彼女が言わないことに耳を澄ませなさい。"

# game/case03.rpy:125
translate japanese case3_0354f18b:

    # sakuya_t "At three o'clock, the mistress's pudding was in the kitchen. I placed it there myself."
    sakuya_t "三時、お嬢様のプリンは厨房にありました。私自身が置いたのです。"

# game/case03.rpy:126
translate japanese case3_b27a2582:

    # sakuya_t "At five past three, the plate was empty. Only the spoon remained."
    sakuya_t "三時五分、お皿は空でした。残っていたのはスプーンだけ。"

# game/case03.rpy:127
translate japanese case3_c2f25894:

    # sakuya_t "Only two people could possibly have eaten it."
    sakuya_t "食べられたのは、二人のうちどちらかしかありえません。"

# game/case03.rpy:131
translate japanese case3_9ed50f72:

    # eiki "Cross-examine, Junior Judge. Quickly. She has already checked her watch twice."
    eiki "反対尋問を、見習い判事。手早く。彼女はもう二度も時計を見ています。"

# game/case03.rpy:145
translate japanese case3_cross_92e93072:

    # eiki "Again. The pudding is not getting any less eaten."
    eiki "もう一度。プリンが食べられていない状態に戻るわけではありません。"

# game/case03.rpy:156
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_1ae3ffaa:

    # you "Your mansion holds dozens of people. You offered the court exactly two."
    you "あなたの館には何十人もいる。なのに法廷に出したのはたった二人だ。"

# game/case03.rpy:157
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_5e393fa8:

    # you "Fairy maids, the mistress's sister, a certain magician. Any of them could have eaten it."
    you "妖精メイド、妹様、ある魔法使い。誰が食べてもおかしくない。"

# game/case03.rpy:160
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_1ec5755b:

    # sakuya "...Forty fairy maids. I didn't count the fairy maids."
    sakuya "……妖精メイド四十人。妖精メイドを数えていませんでした。"

# game/case03.rpy:164
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_062abc7c:

    # eiki "A false dilemma. Two doors painted on a wall, and you are told to pick one."
    eiki "誤った二分法。壁に描いた扉が二つ。どちらかを選べと言われるのです。"

# game/case03.rpy:165
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_63db6fbe:

    # eiki "When someone offers only two choices, ask who took away the others."
    eiki "選択肢を二つしか示されなかったら、残りを誰が隠したのか問いなさい。"

# game/case03.rpy:172
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_8c9ba004:

    # eiki "In the matter of Hong Meiling and the vanished pudding, this court finds the defendant..."
    eiki "紅美鈴と消えたプリンの件につき、当法廷は被告人を……"

# game/case03.rpy:183
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_8ea0bb4d:

    # eiki "The pudding remains at large."
    eiki "プリンはいまだ逃走中です。"

# game/case03.rpy:186
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_bd62757d:

    # sakuya "I'll find the real culprit. I have all the time in the world. Literally."
    sakuya "真犯人は私が見つけます。時間ならいくらでもありますので。文字通り。"

# game/case03.rpy:196
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_3ed88655:

    # komachi "...She does that."
    komachi "……あれ、よくやるんです。"

# game/case03.rpy:197
translate japanese case3_breakthrough_6b25a3b4:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned. Someone wake the defendant and tell her she won."
    eiki "閉廷します。誰か被告人を起こして、勝ったと伝えてあげなさい。"

